      "id": 1,
      "text": "Goleta Valley Historical Society began modestly in 1967, taking stewardship of Rancho La Patera, the Stow family ranch.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
