      ],
      "source": "https://goletahistory.org/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Stow House and South Coast Railroad Museum are preserved landmarks connecting to the valley’s past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
