        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://phase3projects.com/_clients/gvhs/index.html",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The valley lies between Goleta, Santa Barbara, the Pacific, and the Santa Ynez Mountains.",
